    <statement><p>If a parametric surface given by 
<m>\mathbf{r_{1}}(u, v) = f(u, v)\mathbf{i} + g(u, v)\mathbf{j} + 
  h(u, v)\mathbf{k}</m> and  
<m>-4 \leq u \leq 4, -4 \leq v \leq 4</m>, has surface area equal to 4, 
