<m>\mathbf{r_{2}}(u, v) = 3\mathbf{r_{1}}(u, v)</m> with 
<m>-4 \leq u \leq 4, -4 \leq v \leq 4</m>?</p>
<p><fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
